  "verdict": "void",
  "section": "106",
  "quote": "The amount of a rent deposit shall not be more than the lesser of the amount of rent for one rent period and the amount of rent for one month.",
  "reason": "Section 106(2) restricts a rent deposit to at most one month's rent, and under section 4(1) any lease provision inconsistent with the Act is void. Requiring a deposit equal to two months' rent exceeds this statutory limit."
}

